  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-one-little-bite-v10-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "da8428219b1ac837b24b4b4797ae69565fdad47fb3c374328ab4cfe96f40ca7f",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7e14557e96cc366867b7ff6617a4b4b40bbfc0b42b247b1f3db61fb32c0f18f8",
      "text": "悟空\n尝一小口",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "76380c45ec5681220c3956abffd464a489f09349049d76659f5c9d5122ba1590",
      "text": "太阳慢慢落山了。\n悟空抱着他的桃子。\n“我只吃桃子！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6999027ac01ab85bf97330f00e30544fc331da943818babd918fd936664cc5de",
      "text": "“来帮忙做晚饭吧。”\n八戒说。\n悟空帮忙洗胡萝卜。\n哗啦！鼻子也湿了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "938bdf89b39283eb1d07912aa59fe6bf1eaee766361dfb6bd64fd0c12dc2efc8",
      "text": "沙僧搅着锅里的菜。\n一片叶子落在\n悟空的桃子上。\n“我的桃子戴帽子啦！”\n他咯咯地笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec394eeaacecf1e42b3ddfbf4f881033a8001224f5a35ace8d28169cac66b4dc",
      "text": "一股香味飘过来。\n“那是什么呀？”悟空问。\n“热乎乎的胡萝卜呀。”\n沙僧说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6efe7660b80f1dd12a1126ed4eb1cbb8a173ba904a1e09802c1be0bd7e245457",
      "text": "悟空尝了一小口。\n“哦！又甜又软。”\n他把桃子\n放在碗旁边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e850c86cec3b0fa804db197afa35bece1ba86ff159edd70652353d31931f0508",
      "text": "“再尝片青菜？”\n悟空咬了一小口。\n“嗯，软软的，还有汁呢！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "38fd4d9569c605c7de836f89ade654f5b8b2273726d243dbc597dc76bb091802",
      "text": "他尝了米饭，\n还有小块小块的豆腐。\n这个尝一点，\n那个尝一点。\n“我的碗里有新朋友啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5f8f86bd70d2090f04c5446d2601e3fcd597354c6823c03e16e90414690da9a3",
      "text": "月光洒在餐桌上。\n悟空吃完最后一口桃子。\n“桃子好吃，这些也好吃！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "08dd31060dc6d2160a3f6d2d009be0a1517300a497b460d00d7b4ebb02ccb533",
      "text": "悟空钻进被窝。\n“晚安，小饭碗。\n晚安，朋友们。”\n明天，他还可以\n尝尝新东西。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
